      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Permission and verification boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Runtime delta requires an approved delta.",
        "Before runtime writes: approval, recoverable backup and rollback. After: saved readback and minimal live check.",
        "Failed checks are reported blocked, not accepted.",
        "Executor returns patch/evidence; Coordinator is communication, not execution."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Proposed status",
      "items": [
